{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Fish Smoker is a type of ",["l","打造","Artisan Equipment"]," that is used to create ",["l","熏鱼","smoked fish"]," using any ",["l","鱼","fish"]," and 1 ",["l","煤炭","coal"],". It doubles the sell price of a fish while retaining quality, as well as multiplying the ",["l","能量","energy"]," and ",["l","生命值","health"]," restoration by 1.5. The smoker accepts ",["l","鱼","Legendary Fish"]," as well as ",["l","蟹笼","Crab Pot"]," specific fish, making the latter edible."]],["p",["It can be crafted after purchasing the recipe from the ",["l","鱼店","Fish Shop"]," for 10,000g. It is also a possible reward as the 12th prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园","Prize Machine"]," in the Mayor's Manor (50% chance). Players on the ",["l","农场地图","Riverland Farm"]," start with one Fish Smoker."]]]],["Products",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Processing Time"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]}],[[["l","熏鱼","Smoked Fish"]],["A whole fish, smoked to perfection."],["Any ",["l","鱼","Fish"]," (1) ",["i","(O)382","Coal ×1"]],["50 mins"],["2 × Fish Price"],["Energy 1.5 × Fish EnergyHealth 1.5 × Fish Health"]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","打造","Crafting"]]],["Ingredients",[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×10"],["i","(O)SeaJelly","Sea Jelly ×1"],["i","(O)RiverJelly","River Jelly ×1"],["i","(O)CaveJelly","Cave Jelly ×1"]]],["Sell Price",["Cannot be sold"]]]}